OL,3,GNEWSAGregory Campbell under
OL,4,Ainvestigation for alleged spending
OL,5,Abreach
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe parliamentary watchdog has launched
OL,8,Fan investigation into the Democratic
OL,9,FUnionist Party (DUP) MP Gregory
OL,10,FCampbell over potential spending
OL,11,Fbreaches.
OL,13,FThe Independent Parliamentary Standards
OL,14,FAuthority (IPSA) said it will determine
OL,15,Fwhether Campbell has been "paid an
OL,16,Famount under the Scheme of MPs Staffing
OL,17,Fand Business Costs that should not have
OL,18,Fbeen allowed".
OL,20,FNo further information will be
OL,21,Fpublished until the investigation has
OL,22,Fconcluded.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
